{"type":"message","id":"c8bfe7d3","parentId":"740bc242","timestamp":"2026-02-19T06:00:11.956Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create the project files.","thinkingSignature":"d388bff79eb581cae79740b27a5442db44d35d7900f2cab4e1feb24f3ec1ed1f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3yzwwuhxrguv_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# WebSecurityGuide\nWeb 安全攻防渗透测试实战指南\n\n## 项目简介\n\n本项目提供 Web 安全渗透测试的实战指南，包含工具搭建、漏洞利用和防御策略。\n\n## 目录结构\n\n```\nWebSecurityGuide/\n├── docs/           # 文档教程\n│   ├── chapter1-环境搭建.md\n│   ├── chapter2-SQL注入.md\n│   └── chapter3-信息收集.md\n├── tools/          # 工具集\n└── practice/       # 靶场练习\n```\n\n## 章节内容\n\n### Chapter 1: 环境搭建\n- VMWare 虚拟化平台\n- Kali Linux 渗透测试系统\n- Docker 环境搭建\n- 漏洞靶场：Metasploitable2、DVWA、SQLI-LABS、upload-labs\n\n### Chapter 2: SQL 注入\n- SQLMap 工具使用\n- 注入实战演练\n\n### Chapter 3: 信息收集\n- 被动侦察（Whois、Sublist3r）\n- 网络空间测绘（Shodan、FOFA）\n- CMS 指纹识别（WhatWeb）\n\n## 快速开始\n\n详见各章节文档。\n","path":"/home/ecs-user/.openclaw/workspace/projects/WebSecurityGuide/README.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-cn","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":110595,"output":297,"cacheRead":18191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":129083,"cost":{"input":1.658925,"output":0.01782,"cacheRead":0.036382,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.7131269999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771480804449}}
{"type":"message","id":"2d02c435","parentId":"c8bfe7d3","timestamp":"2026-02-19T06:00:12.008Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_3yzwwuhxrguv_1","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 559 bytes to /home/ecs-user/.openclaw/workspace/projects/WebSecurityGuide/README.md"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1771480811976}}
{"type":"message","id":"b0f3b8c6","parentId":"2d02c435","timestamp":"2026-02-19T06:00:27.039Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create the chapter files.","thinkingSignature":"e6fbf40bd62048dfee7d767faec24d8c9f6609a3f25229f7bc1069f4037ddf38"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xnyrhv984jle_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Chapter 1: 环境搭建\n\n## 1.1 安装渗透测试平台\n\n### 1.1.1 VMWare\n\nVMWare 是一个虚拟化平台，允许用户在单个物理机器上运行多个操作系统。\n\n**安装步骤：**\n1. 从官方网站下载 VMWare 安装包\n2. 运行安装包并按照提示安装\n3. 接受许可协议并选择安装位置\n4. 选择安装类型（典型或自定义）\n5. 完成安装\n\n**创建虚拟机：**\n1. 启动 VMWare → 创建新虚拟机\n2. 选择虚拟机类型（Windows/Linux）\n3. 选择操作系统和架构（32位/64位）\n4. 分配资源（CPU、内存、磁盘空间）\n5. 选择网络设置（桥接、NAT、主机only）\n6. 创建虚拟硬盘\n7. 安装操作系统\n\n### 1.1.2 Kali Linux\n\nKali Linux 是基于 Linux 的渗透测试操作系统。\n\n**安装步骤：**\n1. 下载 Kali Linux VMware 镜像\n2. 在 VMware 中导入镜像（.vmx 文件）\n3. 启动 Kali Linux\n   - 默认用户名：`kali`\n   - 默认密码：`kali`\n4. 配置网络、虚拟硬件、共享文件夹\n\n## 1.2 安装 Docker 环境\n\n### Docker 基本用法\n\n| 功能 | 命令 |\n|------|------|\n| 运行容器 | `docker run -it ubuntu /bin/bash` |\n| 列出容器 | `docker ps -a` |\n| 停止容器 | `docker stop <container_id>` |\n| 删除容器 | `docker rm <container_id>` |\n| 创建镜像 | `docker build -t myimage .` |\n| 拉取镜像 | `docker pull myimage` |\n\n## 1.3 搭建漏洞环境\n\n### 1.3.1 Metasploitable2\n\n基于 Linux 的渗透测试环境，包含多种常见漏洞。\n\n**下载地址：** https://github.com/rapid7/metasploitable2\n\n### 1.3.2 DVWA (Damn Vulnerable Web Application)\n\n**Docker 搭建：**\n```bash\ndocker run -d -p 8080:80 --name dvwa vulnerables/web-dvwa\n# 访问 http://localhost:8080\n# 默认用户名/密码: admin/admin\n```\n\n### 1.3.3 SQLI-LABS\n\nSQL 注入练习平台。\n\n**Docker 搭建：**\n```bash\ndocker pull acgpiano/sqli-labs\ndocker run -d -p 8081:80 --name sqli-labs acgpiano/sqli-labs\n# 访问 http://localhost:8081\n```\n\n### 1.3.4 Upload-Labs\n\n文件上传漏洞练习平台。\n\n**Docker 搭建：**\n```bash\ndocker pull c0ny1/upload-labs\ndocker run -d -p 8082:80 --name upload-labs c0ny1/upload-labs\n# 访问 http://localhost:8082\n```\n\n## 靶场端口汇总\n\n| 靶场 | 端口 |\n|------|------|\n| DVWA | 8080 |\n| SQLI-LABS | 8081 |\n| Upload-Labs | 8082 |\n","path":"/home/ecs-user/.openclaw/workspace/projects/WebSecurityGuide/docs/chapter1-环境搭建.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-cn","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":110930,"output":730,"cacheRead":18191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":129851,"cost":{"input":1.66395,"output":0.0438,"cacheRead":0.036382,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.744132}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771480812008}}
