{"type":"message","id":"c079103b","parentId":"cc37eb9e","timestamp":"2026-02-19T06:03:42.724Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"根据搜索结果，常见的 Web 安全渗透测试章节包括：\n1. SQL 注入 (已完成)\n2. XSS 跨站脚本攻击\n3. CSRF 跨站请求伪造\n4. 文件上传漏洞\n5. 文件包含\n6. SSRF\n7. 密码攻击\n8. 命令注入\n9. 逻辑漏洞\n\n让我先完善已有的前三章，然后添加新章节。","thinkingSignature":"b4968a13ec7f0c78c84033a9eae9348f82cd0f5a1dd8f082d8c194962104555d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qodljqm6pgqg_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"XSS攻击类型 反射型 存储型 DOM型 防御方法"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-cn","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":115464,"output":125,"cacheRead":18208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":133797,"cost":{"input":1.73196,"output":0.007500000000000001,"cacheRead":0.036416,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.775876}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771481008749}}
