{"type":"message","id":"2a363b27","parentId":"0a183213","timestamp":"2026-02-19T07:47:41.667Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在创建 requirements.txt 文件，列出所有必要的依赖工具。","thinkingSignature":"8fceb46619628c78e90c346fa9258cd2b91911747f2a1ff2004aad7094baa0d0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_hx3bp8ogv3w8_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Web Security Skill - 依赖工具\n# 基于 WebSecurityGuide: https://github.com/Espl0it/WebSecurityGuide\n\n# ============ 系统工具 (Kali Linux 已预装) ============\n\n# 端口扫描\n# nmap\n\n# SQL 注入\n# sqlmap\n\n# Web 漏洞扫描\n# nikto\n\n# 暴力破解\n# hydra\n\n# 密码破解\n# john\n\n# 指纹识别\n# whatweb\n\n# 网络工具\n# netcat\n\n# ============ Python 工具 (pip install) ============\n\n# XSS 扫描\nxsstrike>=3.1.0\n\ndalfox>=2.0.0\n\n# 子域名枚举\nsublist3r>=1.0\n\n# 目录扫描\nffuf>=2.0.0\n\n# Web 目录暴破\ngobuster>=3.1.0\n\n# ============ 可选工具 ============\n\n# WordPress 扫描\nwpscan>=3.8.0\n\n# 社会工程学工具集\nthe-harvester>=3.0.0\n\n# 侦察框架\n# recon-ng (pipx install recon-ng)\n\n# 子域名枚举增强\namass>=3.19.0\n\n# ============ Docker 靶场 (可选) ============\n\n# 靶场环境可使用 docker-compose 快速搭建\n# 见: https://github.com/Espl0it/WebSecurityGuide\n\n# ============ 安装脚本 ============\n\n# 安装所有 Python 依赖:\n# pip3 install -r requirements.txt\n\n# 安装系统工具 (Debian/Ubuntu):\n# sudo apt install nmap sqlmap nikto hydra john whatweb netcat\n\n# Kali Linux 用户:\n# 所有工具已预装\n","path":"/home/ecs-user/.openclaw/workspace/skills/web-security/requirements.txt"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-cn","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":126193,"output":425,"cacheRead":18213,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":144831,"cost":{"input":1.892895,"output":0.025500000000000002,"cacheRead":0.036426,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.9548210000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771487253290}}
